{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"俄罗斯","country_iso":"RUS","created_at":"2026-03-23T10:58:53.259693","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"RUS-HB-0004","ldc":"No","location":"","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"俄罗斯“光伏+储能”清洁供暖项目","project_name_en":"Russia \"PV+Storage\" Clean Heating Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"中国电工","content":"近日，俄罗斯铜业公司总裁Levin Vsevolod Vadimovich先生应邀到访中国电工并开展业务交流，公司董事长赵辉接待来访一行，副总经理李志刚以及第二事业部有关人员陪同会见。\n在赵辉董事长的陪同下，Levin总裁一行首先参观了公司展厅，了解公司的业务情况，对公司在电力工程总承包领域的成绩和技术实力表示赞赏。\n在随后的会谈中，赵辉董事长对来访客人表示热情欢迎，并向他们介绍了公司在能源领域的项目执行能力和典型业绩。总裁先生对赵辉董事长的接待表示感谢，并对公司多项业绩表示出浓厚兴趣，双方团队就计划合作开发的电力设施及可再生能源综合利用等项目展开深入交流。\n交流结束后\n双方就远东铜金选矿厂配套自备电站项目、“光伏+储能”清洁供暖项目及矿山设备成套供货项目签署了合作备忘录。","content_sha256":"de42a0335b2bc0f9beeeaa6052ae9e20f488a12a5a96e6b3883f903be40f0359","id":13901,"publish_date":"2023-03-22 12:40:47","title":"中国电工与俄罗斯铜业公司开展业务交流并签署合作备忘录","title_sha256":"429fbe9676e77a3f102f7d4eef26b5980714f4f784c1b1d009d225eda39bfa1b","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/38289.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"RUS-HB-0004","capacity_details":"PV: null, BESS: null","capacity_mw":null,"capacity_mw_raw":"","capacity_source":null,"contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T10:58:53.259974","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"RUS-HB-0004-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[\"https://webadmin.chinacable.com/news/details/4168\"]","official_website_links":"[]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"俄罗斯铜业公司","project_developer_en":"Russian Copper Company","project_stage":"拟开发","project_summary":"中国电工与俄罗斯铜业公司签署合作备忘录，计划合作开发“光伏